// launch entry point.
//
// two stages: RunLib.ZC builds the engine, this file builds the app shell and
// starts it. RunLib.ZC documents the include order, which is load-bearing -
// ZealC is single-pass, so a file can reference symbols only from an earlier
// one. utils/hl1-checkorder.py enforces it.

Cd(__DIR__);;

"HL1 build:\n";

ExeFile("RunLib");

"  .. HL1\n";
#include "HL1"

HL1;

"\nType $$LTBLUE$$HLTest;$$FG$$ to run the data-layer self-check.\n";
